    narr:generatedFrom "3d701e5703aa3f959ba54d59603077ba4a8ce3db" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative began as the interview-flywheel motion — [one expert conversation producing three outputs: installable perspective, published content, live demo](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_4), framed as [a content flywheel that also builds marketplace supply](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_5) — with [the breakthrough that demo call, marketing content, and onboarding are the same event](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_3). Its origin runs through [Tanya's casual musing about packaging interviews as installable expertise](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_7) and [seeding first modules with expertise from people she knows](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_34), instantiated in [Freya wanting to interview himself into an installable design-approach perspective](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_37) as [one of the first marketplace perspectives](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_38), with [his grasp of how the interview removes the expert's setup barrier](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_41). Execution details include [hosting/subdomain plans where the published version should feel like a media property](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_44) and [outreach templates committing to explicit free-vs-paid terms, no bait and switch](narr:Expr_1RealFreyaPodcastSalesMotion20260323_45). A second thread has since grown alongside: [Tess's challenge that texting carries a spam-trained trust cost in skeptical contexts](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9), grounded in [seven rejected toll-free numbers](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_14), answered by [a chat widget on the share page for evaluator and demo contexts](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_30) with [one widget per share ID architecture](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_22) and [a Front widget spike to test automation](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_68).""" ;
